Result graded left identity:
  Attribution: topology; graded map left identity; original
  Let K: Type
  Let field: FieldStructure(K)
  Let M,N: GradedModule(K,field)
  Let f: GradedMap(K,field,M,N)
  Conclude: graded composition(field,M,M,N,graded identity(field,M),f) = f

Result graded right identity:
  Attribution: topology; graded map right identity; original
  Let K: Type
